  "problem": "A matrix $A$ has the characteristic equation $2{\\lambda }^{3}-3{\\lambda }^{2}-4=0.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $\\lambda =2$ is a root of the characteristic equation\n\nII. $\\lambda =0$ is an eigenvalue of $A$\n\nIII. $A$ is invertible",
